   "id": 545026,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "In a plurality election, the candidates have the following vote counts: A 125, B 132, C 149, D 112. The pairwise matchup points for each candidate would have been: A 1, B 3, C 1, D 1.",
