  {
   "id": 545028,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "In a pairwise comparison election, the four candidates initially received the following points for winning matchups: A 2, B <span data-math=\"1\\frac{1}{2}\">1\\frac{1}{2}</span>,\n<span data-math=\"1\\frac{1}{2}\">1\\frac{1}{2}</span>, C 1, D  <span data-math=\"1\\frac{1}{2}\">1\\frac{1}{2}</span>. When candidate C dropped out of the election, the remaining candidates received: A 1, B  <span data-math=\"1\\frac{1}{2}\">1\\frac{1}{2}</span>, D <span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span>.",
   "answers": [],
